ttps://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kCukw0yDFHsQ7kNvwH04IO-&_nc_oc=AdnnbB73C4k1WJ00-W1DbpMUwnrjZ1cXYTIiodgu6s6UVD3dqMmqiMq9vPsXha7_KsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxnSA8jjn6KjlAdJ_tXf7oWlkmB7vM92hzM_z7zWne7Zg&oe=69B00F67"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Um__DKJBIY0Q7kNvwG_Cs6j&_nc_oc=AdmdPM-0MTyC9lm7gqJ8opjiTw0Ool1POrSqtc5Zs8u5huXzI3f6E9G4_T0nXXQr6_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyV4GTliUA7vZ3_4_i62JWOl3cSzDVdmXDuyUeYeGoMNw&oe=69B02A89"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sagalegendsdev.github.io